New Party-Finding Mechanic

Looking for comrades is now becoming easier! New mechanic arrives in Royal Quest

A brand-new party-finding interface is coming to the game on February 11!

That’s how it works:

- the search occurs in the location you are in while taking into account the difference in character levels;
- the search starts with the level difference of 5, then it extends by 5 levels with each minute passed finally reaching the maximum level difference of 25;
- if you move to another location, the search continues there.
But that’s not all:

- parties are merged automatically;

- the leader of a larger party becomes the leader of a merged party;
- the search is off either when a party has 8 players, or when the leader turns the search off;
- a leader can initiate the search if their party has less than 8 players;
- the search icon is visible only to the party leader, while new players join the party immediately.

The party-finding mechanic will be improved and get new features in the future. What would you add to it? Share with us in the comments!

Dear friends,
The year is coming to an end and looking back, we’d like to summarize it.
 Royal Quest Online 2024 milestones:
- 1 new boss and 1 new permanent NPC;
- release on 2 new platforms - BASE and Steam;
- 3 new languages (Simplified Chinese, Latin American Spanish and BrazilianPortuguese);
- 3 merged and 5 new servers;
- first event with Season Pass mechanics;
- about 50 mounts, costumes, jewelry, and pets.

The year 2024 attracted an army of new players to the game - both newcomers and Royal Quest Online veterans! Thank you for your love, for playing and active participation in the community life, feedback, advice and wishes.

The plans for 2025 are huge: adding new content, improving class balance, modifying castle siege mechanics and more. Let's welcome the New Year together, congratulate each other and look forward to the wonders that 2025 will bring us!

[b]Hooray! Happy New Year![/b]

Dear friends,
Our team is actively tracking your works on social media and would like to honor our community's most talented creators. We are thrilled to announce that we are launching a contest for the best Royal Quest video, where the winner will be awarded a [b]Legendary Dragon Treasure Box[/b]! 


[b]Here are the rules:[/b]

- Film a vertical video featuring Royal Quest. It can be anything: a funny sketch, gameplay footage or even your pro tip for other players;
- Upload it to your YouTube, Tik-Tok, Instagram or Likee channel between December 28, 2024 and January 14 (inclusively), 2025;
- Ensure the video is available to everyone and add the hashtags #royalquest and #royalquestonline in the description;
- Join the official Royal Quest Online Discord server;
- Send the link to your video [url=https://discord.com/channels/583279092590313482/1322482454728015904]to the special “Video Contest” channel (in Discord)[/url] and specify the server and the nickname of the character to which you want us to send the reward in case of winning;
- Editing a comment with a video link is forbidden;
- Every participant can upload an unlimited number of videos;
- By posting a video, the author confirms that the materials used are created by them or taken from other sources with the permission of the authors of used materials;
- Royal Quest team reserves the right to not accept videos that violate the Community Rules or contain inappropriate content.

[b]How do we pick the winner?[/b]

On January 14, Royal Quest team will pick the best work and then count community votes to choose a second winner!  
Yes, you heard right! There will be two winners: one of whom will be chosen by the players!
The author of the video that gets the most 👍 (thumbs up) reactions in “Video contest” channel between December 28, 2024 and January 14, 2025 (inclusively) will become the second winner.


[b]What are the rewards?[/b]

[b]Legendary Dragon Treasure Box[/b] — each containing 38 appearance items from 2024 Boxes: skins, mounts, decorations and more!
Rewards will be added to the winners' accounts between January 15 and January 21.


Turn on your cameras, kick off the screen recording and don't miss the chance to grab the biggest reward of the passing year!

Maybe your video will be recognized by Royal Quest team as well and the entire community!

